										Yes
										<img src="/Images/radio-checked.jpg" alt="No is checked">
										No
									</span></td></tr></table></div><h1>NPORT-P: Part B: Information About the Fund </h1><div class="form1"><table xmlns:n1="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/common_drp" xmlns:ns2="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/statecodes" xmlns:ns3="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/regacommon"><tr><td>Report the following information for the Fund and its consolidated subsidiaries.</td></tr></table><h4 xmlns:n1="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/common_drp" xmlns:ns2="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/statecodes" xmlns:ns3="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/regacommon">Item B.1. Assets and liabilities. Report amounts in U.S. dollars.</h4><table xmlns:n1="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/common_drp" xmlns:ns2="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/statecodes" xmlns:ns3="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/regacommon"><tr><td class="label">a. Total assets, including assets attributable to miscellaneous securities reported in Part D.
