				</td><td><div class="fakeBox4">2347421395.77<span> </span></div></td></tr></table><h4 xmlns:n1="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/common_drp" xmlns:ns2="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/statecodes" xmlns:ns3="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/regacommon">Item B.2. Certain assets and liabilities.  Report amounts in U.S. dollars.</h4><table xmlns:n1="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/common_drp" xmlns:ns2="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/statecodes" xmlns:ns3="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/regacommon"><tr><td class="label">a. Assets attributable to miscellaneous securities reported in Part D. 
				</td><td><div class="fakeBox4">0.00000000<span> </span></div></td></tr><tr><td class="label">b. Assets invested in a Controlled Foreign Corporation for the purpose of investing in certain types of instruments such as, but not limited to, commodities.
				</td><td><div class="fakeBox4">0.00000000<span> </span></div></td></tr></table><p xmlns:n1="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/common_drp" xmlns:ns2="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/statecodes" xmlns:ns3="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/regacommon">c. Borrowings attributable to amounts payable for notes payable, bonds, and similar debt, as reported pursuant to rule 6-04(13)(a) of Regulation S-X [17 CFR 210.6-04(13)(a)].</p><table xmlns:n1="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/common_drp" xmlns:ns2="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/statecodes" xmlns:ns3="http://www.sec.gov/edgar/regacommon"><tr><td>Amounts payable within one year.</td></tr><tr><td class="label">Banks or other financial institutions for borrowings.
				</td><td><div class="fakeBox4">0.00000000<span> </span></div></td></tr><tr><td class="label">Controlled companies.
